    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "api_endpoint=\"https://api.smith.langchain.com/v2/sandboxes\","
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "api_key=\"your-api-key\","
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "## AWS Auth Proxy"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "Use the AWS auth proxy when sandbox code needs to call AWS services such as S3,"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "result = sb.run(\"python your_aws_script.py\")"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "print(result.stdout)"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "credential values are not accepted directly by the AWS auth proxy; wrap"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "## GCP Auth Proxy"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "Use the GCP auth proxy when sandbox code needs to call Google APIs. You"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "bearer tokens for Google API hosts matched automatically by the sandbox proxy."
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "scopes=[\"https://www.googleapis.com/auth/devstorage.read_write\"],"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "result = sb.run(\"python your_gcp_script.py\")"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "print(result.stdout)"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "mount target. Provider credentials stay in `mount_config.auth`; the backend"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "expands them into runtime proxy auth rules. You can also pass `proxy_config` for"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "generic egress rules. Explicit AWS/GCP proxy auth rules conflict with"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "`mount_config` auth for the same provider."
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "S3 mounts require AWS auth:"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "auth=["
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "result = sb.run(\"ls /mnt/mounts/customer-data\")"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "print(result.stdout)"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "GCS mounts require GCP auth:"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "auth=["
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "result = sb.run(\"ls /mnt/mounts/customer-data\")"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "print(result.stdout)"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "Public Git mounts do not require AWS or GCP auth:"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "result = sb.run(\"ls /mnt/repo\")"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "print(result.stdout)"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "requires proxy-managed auth. There is not yet a high-level private Git auth"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "They do not require AWS or GCP auth, and unlike bucket and Git mounts they can"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "`/mnt/mounts`. The caller's API key must have access to the repo:"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "result = await sb.run(\"ls /memories\")"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "print(result.stdout)"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "bucket provider auth blocks and all mount specs:"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "auth=["
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "result = sb.run(\"echo 'Hello, World!'\")"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "print(result.stdout)     # \"Hello, World!\\n\""
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "print(result.stderr)     # \"\""
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "print(result.exit_code)  # 0"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "print(result.success)    # True"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "result = sb.run(\"exit 1\")"
    },
    {
      "source": ".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/langsmith/sandbox/README.md",
      "text": "print(result.success)    # False"
    }
  ]
